            "When Mr.Caryle is summoned, he Initiates Tangled Agony to entangle enemies within 2 tiles, dealing 140% (ATK-based) damage per second for 2s.",
            "The entangled enemies cannot move or act.",
            "If Mr.Carlyle is already on battlefield when this skill is used again, the skill restores his HP to Max, allowing him to cast the Tangled Agony again."
          ],
